«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  GammaCDFc
  @  Upper tail at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "GammaCDFc: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → av scv Xv « av 0 + scv 0 + Xv 0 + → a sc X « '1-(IFTE(X≤0;0;GammaP(a;X/sc)))' →Num av scv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
